    Array([[2.5],
           [4. ],
           [5. ]], dtype=float32)

    To use only specific elements of ``x`` to compute the mean, you can use
    ``where``.

    >>> where = jnp.array([[1, 0, 1, 0],
    ...                    [0, 1, 0, 1],
    ...                    [1, 1, 0, 1]], dtype=bool)
    >>> jnp.mean(x, axis=1, keepdims=True, where=where)
    Array([[2.5],
